<p class="docx-para">TABLE OF CONTENTS</p>
<p class="docx-para">OBJECTIVE:</p>
<p class="docx-para">The protocol provides guidelines for the requalification of Air Handling Unit ID. No. SK/ENG/AHU-005 in the facility of Lupin Ltd. Sikkim to establish high degree of assurance that the equipment is maintained at a qualified stage since its initial installation and is fit for its intended use when operated as per applicable SOP.</p>
<p class="docx-para">SCOPE: <span class="docx-readonly-value" data-field="para_19">—</span></p>
<p class="docx-para">This protocol provides directions / procedure for requalification to provide documented evidence that Air Handling Unit is operated in accordance with the requirements of the product, process, and safety and cGMP norms.</p>
<p class="docx-para">The subjected equipment is identified as Air Handling Unit ID. No. SK/ENG/AHU-005 located at Service Floor.</p>
<table class="docx-table">
<tr>
<td class="docx-cell" style="border:1px solid #000;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:middle;font-weight:bold;">Details</td>
