":"AHU Dimension","location":"table_6_row_7","value":"dgdgdg","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Capacity","location":"table_6_row_8","value":"dgdgd","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"MOC of AHU Frame","location":"table_6_row_9","value":"gdgd","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Area Catering to","location":"table_6_row_10","value":"gdgdg","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Area Classification","location":"table_6_row_11","value":"dgdgd","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"No. of Supply grill","location":"table_6_row_12","value":"gdgd","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"No. of return riser \/ grill","location":"table_6_row_13","value":"gdsg","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Connected Accessories","location":"table_7_row_0","value":"Description","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Blower \/ motor:","location":"table_7_row_1","value":"Plug type Blower provided in the unit to supply air in the working area, and is directly mount on the motor shaft. The blower recirculates the air by taking the air from the atmosphere and rooms as return air and delivers it to the working areas through supply and return duct. It is capable of developing the static pressure of 135 MM of WC.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Cooling Coil:","location":"table_7_row_2","value":"Cooling coil made up of SS body, copper tube and aluminium fins provided in AHU as a heat exchanger. Cooling coils are generally located in the discharge-air stream, immediately downstream of the mixing plenum and filters to de-humidify the air stream. The supply and return line of chilled water \/ brine (2 to 8\u00b0C) from chiller connected to cooling coil.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Heating Coil:","location":"table_7_row_3","value":"Heating coil made up of SS body, copper tube and aluminium fins is provided in AHU as a heat exchanger. Generally, heating coil is located after cooling coil, so that cooled air passed through the coil and required air condition can be maintain before delivered to the area.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Fresh Air filter","location":"table_7_row_4","value":"The fresh air filter consist of G-4 (10 micron) with the efficiency of 90% down to 10 Micron.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Pre filter","location":"table_7_row_5","value":"The pre filter section consist of F-5 (5-micron) filters with the efficiency of 95% down to 5.0 Micron.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Fine filter","location":"table_7_row_6","value":"The fine filter section should consist of F-8 (3 micron) fine filters with the efficiency of 98% down to 3.0 Micron.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Terminal HEPA Filter","location":"table_7_row_7","value":"Terminal HEPA Filter box consist of 0.3 Micron H-14 HEPA filters. These filters filter the air passed from F-8 (3-micron) fine filter before entering into working area. These filters are not washable and not cleanable.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Bleed Air Filter","location":"table_7_row_8","value":"Bleed air filter should be of 0.3 Micron H-14 HEPA filter. These filters filter the air passed from F-5 (5 micron) pre filter before relief the air to the atmosphere. These filters are not washable and not cleanable.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Return air riser filter","location":"table_7_row_9","value":"The fresh air filter consist of G-4 (10 micron) with the efficiency of 90% down to 10 Micron.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Supply & Return Duct","location":"table_7_row_10","value":"The supply & return air ducting provided of 22 & 24 Gauge GI sheets. 3 mm neopr