<p class="docx-para">RESPONSIBILITY:</p>
<p class="docx-para">Responsibilities of different department/ personnel involved in different activities related to the re-qualification are defined below:</p>
<p class="docx-para">Engineering department is responsible to prepare &amp; review the re-qualification protocol in consultation with Validation / QA, execution of the requalification and preparation of re-qualification summary report.</p>
<p class="docx-para">User and engineering department shall execute the re-qualification activity.</p>
<p class="docx-para">Engineering department is responsible to review the protocol for adequacy and accuracy, and to provide the equipment maintenance history.</p>
<p class="docx-para">Validation department is responsible to review the requalification protocol and summary report.</p>
<p class="docx-para">Quality Assurance is responsible to provide guidance, wherever required to the related departments, review &amp; approval of the protocol &amp; requalification report.</p>
