WC.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Cooling Coil:","location":"table_7_row_2","value":"Cooling coil made up of SS body, copper tube and aluminium fins provided in AHU as a heat exchanger. Cooling coils are generally located in the discharge-air stream, immediately downstream of the mixing plenum and filters to de-humidify the air stream. The supply and return line of chilled water \/ brine (2 to 8\u00b0C) from chiller connected to cooling coil.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Heating Coil:","location":"table_7_row_3","value":"Heating coil made up of SS body, copper tube and aluminium fins is provided in AHU as a heat exchanger. Generally, heating coil is located after cooling coil, so that cooled air passed through the coil and required air condition can be maintain before delivered to the area.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Fresh Air filter","location":"table_7_row_4","value":"The fresh air filter consist of G-4 (10 micron) with the efficiency of 90% down to 10 Micron.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Pre filter","location":"table_7_row_5","value":"The pre filter section consist of F-5 (5-micron) filters with the efficiency of 95% down to 5.0 Micron.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Fine filter","location":"table_7_row_6","value":"The fine filter section should consist of F-8 (3 micron) fine filters with the efficiency of 98% down to 3.0 Micron.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Terminal HEPA Filter","location":"table_7_row_7","value":"Terminal HEPA Filter box consist of 0.3 Micron H-14 HEPA filters. These filters filter the air passed from F-8 (3-micron) fine filter before entering into working area. These filters are not washable and not cleanable.","locked":true,"type":"table_2col","widget":"text"},{"label":"Bleed Air Filter","location":"table_7_row_8","value":"Bleed air filter should be